<title>UK: WestLB ups seven-year Pfandbrief to 1.5 bln marks.</title>
<headline>WestLB ups seven-year Pfandbrief to 1.5 bln marks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following Pfandbrief bond was increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Westdeutsche Landesbank, Norddeutsche Landesbank, Bankgesellschaft Berlin and Landesbank Hessen-Thuringen GZ said on Wednesday</p>
<p>The deal as launched on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    12.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  96.40     PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    DUSS	DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *INCLUDES 1.0 BLN MARKS LAUNCHED 03.DEC AT 96.29.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
